cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Psychometric Tools: Interactive Web Applications for Measurement and Assessment Research"
abstract: >-
  Psychometric Tools is a collection of interactive, browser-based web
  applications designed to support psychometric research and teaching. It
  includes: (1) C-NRSBTool, a calculator for the Cumulative Normal Response
  Scale Bias metric; (2) DIF-AnalysisTool, which detects Differential Item
  Functioning (DIF) using Mantel-Haenszel and Thissen-Steinberg-Wainer (TSW)
  likelihood-ratio tests with iterative purification; and (3)
  DIF-AccumulationTool, a simulator that illustrates how item-level DIF effects
  accumulate into systematic total-score differences between groups under the
  Graded Response Model (GRM). All tools run entirely in the browser with no
  installation required. Available online at
  https://enheragu.github.io/psychometric-tools/
